# the volcano. E phrygian, fast and heavy. It should feel like she's winning
tempo 126
rows 4

inst bass  saw      vol 0.14 attack 0.003 decay 0.15 sustain 0.4 release 0.03
inst arp   square   vol 0.07 duty 0.125 attack 0.002 decay 0.1 sustain 0.0
inst lead  square   vol 0.10 duty 0.3 attack 0.01 decay 0.25 sustain 0.5 release 0.08 vibrato 0.015
inst kit   drum     vol 0.26

pattern riff
bass  E2 E2 .  E2 | F2 .  E2 .  | E2 E2 .  E2 | G2 .  F2 .
arp   E4 G4 B4 E5 | F4 A4 C5 F5 | E4 G4 B4 E5 | G4 B4 D5 G5
kit   k  .  h  k  | s  .  h  .  | k  k  h  .  | s  .  h  s

pattern riff_lead
bass  E2 E2 .  E2 | F2 .  E2 .  | E2 E2 .  E2 | G2 .  F2 .
arp   E4 G4 B4 E5 | F4 A4 C5 F5 | E4 G4 B4 E5 | G4 B4 D5 G5
lead  E5 .  .  F5 | E5 .  D5 .  | E5 .  B4 .  | G4 .  .  -
kit   k  .  h  k  | s  .  h  .  | k  k  h  .  | s  .  h  s

pattern climb
bass  A2 A2 .  A2 | G2 .  A2 .  | C3 C3 .  C3 | B2 .  G2 .
arp   A4 C5 E5 A5 | G4 B4 D5 G5 | C5 E5 G5 C6 | B4 D5 F5 B5
lead  A5 .  G5 .  | F5 .  E5 .  | G5 .  .  A5 | B5 .  .  -
kit   k  .  h  k  | s  .  h  k  | k  .  h  k  | s  s  s  c

order riff riff riff_lead riff_lead climb riff_lead climb riff
